# Docker build-context excludes for the repository root.
#
# Both images build from this directory, so this one file governs both of them.
# frontend/.dockerignore is a separate list that only applies when a build is
# rooted at frontend/.
#
# Every rule below is root-anchored or `**/`-scoped and none is a `!`
# re-inclusion, so rule order can never resurrect or hide a file. Nothing a
# Dockerfile COPYs may be added here.

# Version control and repository plumbing.
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# Legacy VB.NET reference trees. Read-only inputs; no image copies them.
Library/
Website/
DotNetNuke.sln
DotNetNuke_VS2008.sln

# Documentation and repository metadata - no image serves documentation.
docs/
blitzy/
mkdocs.yml
catalog-info.yaml
README.md
MIGRATION_NOTES.md

# Root-scoped on purpose: `*` never crosses `/`, so Markdown nested inside a
# subdirectory is not matched and stays in the context.
*.md

# .NET build output. Global rather than backend-scoped: the API image restores
# inside the SDK stage and then publishes with --no-restore, so a host-built
# obj/ arriving in the context would overwrite project.assets.json with host
# paths and break that publish.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/[Dd]ebug/
**/[Rr]elease/
**/x64/
**/x86/
**/artifacts/
**/TestResults/
**/*.trx
**/*.coverage
**/coverage.*.json
**/coverage.*.xml
**/coverage.*.info
**/*.received.*

# Node / Angular output. node_modules/ matters for the same reason: the frontend
# image runs `npm ci` before copying sources, so a host install would replace a
# Linux-native one with host-platform native bindings.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.angular/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache

# Secrets and local environment - never bake credentials into a layer.
# `**/.env*` also covers docker/.env.example: compose interpolates the host .env
# before any build starts, so neither file is needed inside the context. Shipped
# appsettings.*.json stay in the context; only *.local.json overrides are cut.
**/.env*
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.p8
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.ppk
**/*.key
**/*.pem

# IDE / editor / OS noise.
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.userosscache
**/*.userprefs
**/*.suo
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/logs/
**/*.log
